title AVG-04 Approve Application and Register Service in AVG
fontsize 20
gap 180
participant Checker_or_Client_Admin
participant Admin_Portal_Backend
participant DNS_Resolver
participant AVG
participant Zetrix_HSM
participant SSIVC
participant MBI
participant Zetrix_Registry
==REVIEW==
Checker_or_Client_Admin->Admin_Portal_Backend:approve application
Admin_Portal_Backend->Admin_Portal_Backend:approver is not creator or last editor
Admin_Portal_Backend->DNS_Resolver:re-check DNS TXT record
DNS_Resolver-->Admin_Portal_Backend:found
==GO LIVE==
Admin_Portal_Backend->Admin_Portal_Backend:create Service record Active
Admin_Portal_Backend->AVG:register service (required credential, allowed claims, callback URL)
AVG-->Admin_Portal_Backend:API key + HMAC signing secret (key hashed, secret encrypted)
Admin_Portal_Backend->Zetrix_HSM:create service did:zid and did:oan key pairs
Zetrix_HSM-->Admin_Portal_Backend:public keys (private keys stay in HSM)
Admin_Portal_Backend->SSIVC:issue Service Cert (service did:zid, approver = registry controller)
SSIVC->MBI:issue VC with Service Cert template
MBI-->SSIVC:Service Cert ID, validUntil
SSIVC-->Admin_Portal_Backend:Service Cert ID, validUntil
Admin_Portal_Backend-->Zetrix_Registry:create listing + OpenAgenet mirror (async, AVG-08)
Admin_Portal_Backend-->Checker_or_Client_Admin:approved; API key + signing secret shown once
alt SELF-APPROVAL OR TXT RECORD MISSING
Admin_Portal_Backend-->Checker_or_Client_Admin:approval blocked
end
alt SERVICE CERT ISSUE FAILS
Admin_Portal_Backend->Admin_Portal_Backend:service stays Active in AVG; cert issue failed, Retry
end
alt REGISTRY SYNC FAILS
Admin_Portal_Backend->Admin_Portal_Backend:service stays Active in AVG; listing sync failed, Retry
end
